"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Rescuers are using explosives to try to reach workers trapped by flooding. The number of people who have died from the flooding has reached 939.\",            \"english_title\": \"Rescue Efforts in Flood\",            \"translated_version\": \"Los rescatistas usan explosivos para llegar a trabajadores atrapados por la inundaci\u00f3n. El n\u00famero de personas que han muerto por la inundaci\u00f3n ha llegado a 939.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Esfuerzos de Rescate en Inundaci\u00f3n\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"An attack on Larak Island in the Strait of Hormuz has resulted in two deaths and two injuries. This is the first known US strike since late July.\",            \"english_title\": \"Attack on Larak Island\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un ataque en la Isla Larak en el Estrecho de Hormuz ha causado dos muertes y dos heridos. Este es el primer ataque conocido de EE.UU. desde finales de julio.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ataque en Isla Larak\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A 22-year-old Italian woman was killed and several people were injured at a techno rave in Aarau.\",            \"english_title\": \"Tragedy at Techno Rave\",            \"translated_version\": \"Una mujer italiana de 22 a\u00f1os muri\u00f3 y varias personas resultaron heridas en una fiesta techno en Aarau.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Tragedia en Fiesta Techno\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Ayten and Hayri Bicer's two young children are among 20 people missing after an incident that killed eight people.\",            \"english_title\": \"Missing Children After Incident\",            \"translated_version\": \"Los dos hijos peque\u00f1os de Ayten y Hayri Bicer est\u00e1n entre 20 personas desaparecidas despu\u00e9s de un incidente que mat\u00f3 a ocho personas.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ni\u00f1os Desaparecidos Tras Incidente\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Argentina's famous soccer player Lionel Messi has announced he is retiring from international football. He said it was a hard decision, but he knows it is the right time.\",            \"english_title\": \"Messi Retires from International Football\",            \"translated_version\": \"El famoso jugador de f\u00fatbol de Argentina, Lionel Messi, ha anunciado que se retira del f\u00fatbol internacional. Dijo que fue una decisi\u00f3n dif\u00edcil, pero sabe que es el momento correcto.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Messi se Retira del F\u00fatbol Internacional\"        }    ]}"